  "body": "The onsecuritypolicyviolation tests from html/dom/idlharness seems to be failing in chromium/webkit/firefox.\r\n\r\nI was not able to find \"implementation request\" bugs for webkit or firefox.\r\n\r\nIn Chromium, https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/1588381 seems to only expose the attribute for Document, not GlobalEventHandlers.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @fred-wang in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2651#issuecomment-878406431_",
